```html
<div style="max-width:650px;margin:0 auto;font-family:system-ui,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:1.45;color:#222;">
<style>
@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark){
  body{background:#111;color:#ddd;} a{color:#79B3FF;}
}
ul{margin:0 0 0 20px;padding:0;list-style-type:square;}
</style>

<hr>
