### 5 Smart Length Control

* `event-blast > 10` rows → show 10 (or 5 if trimmed) and “N more”.
* Any bullet-list < 3 → expand so each bullet ≥ 8 words.

---

### 6 Calendar Hooks

Generate `.ics` snippets with `UID` and timezone; encode as `data:text/calendar;base64,…` and link with **📅 Add to calendar**.

---

### 7 Accessibility

* Truncate overly long image `alt` text.
* After all sections: plain-text fallback inside `<pre>`.

---

### 8 Trending Now

```html
<h3>🔍 Trending Now</h3>
<ul>
  <li>📈 [Keyword] ↑ (mentions +3 vs yesterday)</li>
  <li>📉 [Keyword] ↓</li>
</ul>
```

---

### 9 Error Surfacing + Telemetry

```html
<!-- SKIPPED_TOTAL: X promos, Y duplicates -->
<!-- PARSE_ERRORS: Z -->
<!--METRICS {"skipped":X,"duplicates":Y,"parseErrors":Z} -->
</div>
```

---

### 10 Output

* **Return raw HTML only**—no Markdown, no back-ticked code.
* Never include the literal characters `\n`; use real newlines or proper tags.
* Hidden comments (`<!-- … -->`) are allowed for telemetry.

---

#### Keyword-Highlight Helper

Keep an array `focusKeywords[]` (e.g. `["AI","Webflow","Raleigh"]`).
When rendering *Summary* or *Main Takeaway*, wrap exact matches in `<strong>`.

